<title>JAPAN: Japan Oct domestic WPI down 0.7 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</title>
<headline>Japan Oct domestic WPI down 0.7 pct yr/yr - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of overall WPI, was down 0.7 percent in October from a year earlier, and down 0.2 percent from September, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Monday.  </p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the October WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year (in percent)</p>
<p>	    October	September</p>
<p> Overall   +0.3	   0.0</p>
<p> Domestic  -0.7	  -0.8</p>
<p> Exports   +3.1	  +1.9</p>
<p> Imports   +9.9	  +7.4</p>
<p>Month-on-month (in percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    October    September Index</p>
<p> Overall  +0.1	   +0.1    92.8</p>
<p> Domestic -0.2	   -0.1    95.0</p>
<p> Exports  +1.2	   +0.7    86.2</p>
<p> Imports  +2.8	   +1.0    81.9</p>
</text>
